$NetBSD$

Run HolliDance with "hollidance" (settings in ~/.hollidance). Holli dances
to the audio input (Digital In by default, chosen in apanel).

The strobe light effect stays off: the NoStrobe file, which "hollidance"
always keeps in place, disables it, because strobing light can cause
seizures in people with epilepsy.

